<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>Contact FileVora — FileVora</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Contact FileVora for support, feedback, privacy questions or security reports."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tool-unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/filevora-header-tools.css">

  <style>
    .contact-content {
      margin-top: 32px;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .contact-content h2 {
      margin: 32px 0 10px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 23px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .contact-content p {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    .contact-options {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .contact-option {
      display: block;
      padding: 22px;
      color: #334155;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d7dce4;
      border-radius: 14px;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .contact-option:hover {
      border-color: #00bc8a;
      background: #ecfdf8;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .contact-option-icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #009a73;
      background: #ecfdf8;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .contact-option strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .contact-option span {
      display: block;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .contact-notice {
      margin: 24px 0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      color: #1e293b;
      background: #ecfdf8;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .contact-notice strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: #009a73;
    }

    .contact-content a:not(.contact-option) {
      color: #009a73;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .contact-options {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include("partials/tool-header") %>

  <main class="info-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">FILEVORA</div>

        <h1>Contact FileVora</h1>

        <p class="info-lead">
          Need help, found a problem or want to share feedback? Contact us using
          our official email address.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-content">
          <div class="contact-options">
            <a
              class="contact-option"
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com&su=FileVora%20Support%20Request"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <div class="contact-option-icon">@</div>
              <strong>Email FileVora</strong>
              <span>filevora5@gmail.com</span>
            </a>

            <a
              class="contact-option"
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com&su=FileVora%20Feedback"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <div class="contact-option-icon">✦</div>
              <strong>Send Feedback</strong>
              <span>Share an idea, suggestion or tool request</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-notice">
            <strong>Official contact address</strong>
            FileVora’s official support email is
            <a href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer">filevora5@gmail.com</a>.
            Please be careful with messages claiming to represent FileVora from
            another address.
          </div>

          <h2>Support Requests</h2>

          <p>
            When reporting a problem with a FileVora tool, please include the
            name of the tool, your browser, your device type and a clear
            description of what happened.
          </p>

          <p>
            A screenshot of the error may help us understand the problem.
            Please remove personal or sensitive information before attaching
            screenshots.
          </p>

          <h2>Privacy Questions</h2>

          <p>
            For questions relating to privacy, cookies or information handling,
            use the subject “Privacy Request” when contacting us. You can also
            review our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>Security Reports</h2>

          <p>
            If you believe you have discovered a security problem affecting
            FileVora, use the subject “Security Report” and provide a clear,
            responsible description of the issue.
          </p>

          <p>
            Do not publicly disclose a suspected vulnerability or attempt to
            access information that does not belong to you. Read our
            <a href="/security">Security page</a> for more information.
          </p>

          <h2>File Attachments</h2>

          <p>
            Do not email passwords, payment details, private keys, identity
            documents, confidential files or other sensitive personal
            information.
          </p>

          <p>
            If a sample file is required to explain a tool problem, use a
            non-sensitive test file whenever possible.
          </p>

          <h2>Response Times</h2>

          <p>
            We review legitimate messages when possible, but response times may
            vary. Sending repeated copies of the same request may delay the
            review process.
          </p>

          <h2>Social Media</h2>

          <p>
            Official FileVora social media links will be published on this
            website when available. Until then, email is the official contact
            method.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
  class="hero-button"
  href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com&su=FileVora%20Support%20Request"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
>
  Email FileVora →
</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">F</span>
          <span class="brand-name">File<span>Vora</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>Fast, simple online tools for everyday file tasks.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Company</h3>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <a href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer">Email</a>
        <a href="/contact">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/contact">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © <span data-current-year></span> FileVora. All rights reserved.
      </span>

      <span>All in One Tool.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-current-year]")
      .forEach(function (element) {
        element.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
      });
  </script>

  <script src="/js/filevora-tools.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/filevora-header-tools.js"></script>

</body>
</html>